	<!-- Cheese making -->
	
	<!-- EN: Select Milk to press in the cheese press. Different milks might produce different types of cheese. -->
  <VCE_InsertMilkDesc>給奶酪壓制器選擇原乳。不同種類的原乳可能會製成不同種類的奶酪。</VCE_InsertMilkDesc>
	<!-- EN: Select Milk -->
  <VCE_InsertMilk>選原乳</VCE_InsertMilk>
	<!-- EN: Insert {0} -->
  <VCE_InsertMilkVariable>加入{0}</VCE_InsertMilkVariable>
	<!-- EN: No milks of that kind found in this map. -->
  <VCE_NoMilksFound>當前地區沒有這種原乳。</VCE_NoMilksFound>
	<!-- EN: Select a type of milk to be pressed -->
  <VCE_SelectMilk>選擇一種準備被壓制的原乳。</VCE_SelectMilk>
	<!-- EN: Bring Milk -->
  <VCE_StartInsertionMilk>添加原乳</VCE_StartInsertionMilk>
	<!-- EN: Bring milk to the cheese press to start pressing -->
  <VCE_StartInsertionMilkDesc>往該奶酪壓制器添加原乳以開始壓制。</VCE_StartInsertionMilkDesc>
	<!-- EN: Remove Milk -->
  <VCE_RemoveMilk>移除原乳</VCE_RemoveMilk>
	<!-- EN: Remove the milk from the press. This can only be done before you start pressing it. -->
  <VCE_RemoveMilkDesc>從該壓制器移除原乳，只能在壓制開始前移除</VCE_RemoveMilkDesc>	
	<!-- EN: Cancel Bringing Milk -->
  <VCE_CancelBringingMilk>取消添加原乳</VCE_CancelBringingMilk>
	<!-- EN: Cancel bringing milk to the cheese press. -->
  <VCE_CancelBringingMilkDesc>取消往該奶酪壓制器添加原乳</VCE_CancelBringingMilkDesc>
	<!-- EN: Wait until the milk has been brought to the cheese press, or cancel the job. -->
  <VCE_WaitTillJobsEndMilk>等待原乳被帶至該奶酪壓制器，或者取消該工作。</VCE_WaitTillJobsEndMilk>
	<!-- EN: Press Into Cheese -->
  <VCE_EngageMilk>開始壓制奶酪</VCE_EngageMilk>
	<!-- EN: Start pressing milk into cheese. This process takes a variable time and cheese will increase in quality with ripening. You can remove it at any time after the initial period. -->
  <VCE_EngageMilkDesc>開始把原乳壓製成奶酪。該過程時間不固定，奶酪質量會隨着時間不斷上升。</VCE_EngageMilkDesc>
